OL,3,GNEWSARacing set to resume at stadium
OL,4,Aafter closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorsports are to resume at a venue in
OL,7,FEast Sussex, its owners have said.
OL,9,FArlington Stadium, near Hailsham,
OL,10,Fstopped its racing in August after 60
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FIts owners said it was due to "ongoing
OL,14,Fserious infrastructure problems which
OL,15,Fdirectly influenced the health and
OL,16,Fsafety of both the public and
OL,17,Fcompetitors".
OL,19,FCo-owner Eric Dugard confirmed that
OL,20,Fracing would resume on 14 November and
OL,21,Fsaid he was "delighted that all issues
OL,22,Fhad now been resolved".
